  <title>AAIG — Quality Engineering, Technical Rework & Global Representation</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Prevent production halts with AAIG — rapid containment, resident engineers, and a 200,000 sq.ft. Wixom warehouse to support inspection, rework, and sequencing across India, North America, and Europe.">
  <meta name="keywords" content="quality engineering, technical rework, inspection services, containment, resident engineer, global representation, automotive quality, manufacturing support, rapid response">
  
